1. SOFTWARE STATUS (SOURCE-AVAILABLE, NOT OPEN SOURCE)
This software ("NovaDAW"), including its source code, executables, user
interfaces, DSP algorithms, documentation, factory presets, audio samples, and
visual assets (collectively, the "Software"), is made available on a
"Source-Available" basis. Although the repository is public, NovaDAW is NOT
free or open-source software as defined by the Open Source Initiative (OSI).
All rights not expressly granted below are reserved by the Author.

